{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_038chz0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_038chz0314_1000_p", "source_sha256": "1081e8856a88a0e1e9748aff67b6e077d05167a5252d0f3846c347e5ea203b66", "ja": "千鶴さん、新しい衣装はどうですか？\n何か気になるところはありませんか？", "zh": "千鹤，新衣服感觉怎么样？\n有没有什么在意的地方？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_038chz0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_038chz0314_1001_038chz", "source_sha256": "a706c3bcbfe76b5099a2b3fb86069baa435a51abf6d5335878fbff69ec00fc62", "ja": "大丈夫ですわ。それにしても、魔法使いですか……。\n子どものころのわたくしに見せてあげたいですわね♪", "zh": "没问题哦。不过，居然是魔法使啊……\n真想让小时候的我看看呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_038chz0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_038chz0314_1002_p", "source_sha256": "c3ab87482cbb4762a890844cf01f45501d37856c7b681b3e05052e3afbb2f747", "ja": "子どものころの千鶴さんに……？", "zh": "给小时候的千鹤看……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_038chz0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_038chz0314_1003_038chz", "source_sha256": "bac97db62f23581ba760ab4326b4491546857836bc7ba61b633183c47103f8f6", "ja": "ええ。小さいころは、\n魔法使いが出てくるアニメをよく見ていましたわ。", "zh": "是的。我小时候，经常看魔法师登场的动画。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_038chz0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_038chz0314_1004_038chz", "source_sha256": "af7304399d33883e7f7c73a0a6bace546721a6c1c904edfd52277e0f98628b1a", "ja": "魔法があれば、どんなこともできる……なんて。\n強く憧れたものです。", "zh": "要是有魔法，就什么都能做到……\n我曾经对此深深憧憬过。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_038chz0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_038chz0314_1005_p", "source_sha256": "1e79d6e1e3586a5174c2f0a427fc6fdc7d50ab2456428782122db95dd87fac1d", "ja": "そうですね。子どものころは特に。いつか、\n自分も魔法が使えるようになるんじゃないかって。", "zh": "是啊。尤其是小时候。那时候总觉得，说不定有一天，  \n自己也能使用魔法。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_038chz0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_038chz0314_1006_038chz", "source_sha256": "7f96a1e19d1ab83f27583abc48a6ee6684d1ec53cbbeeed9a054e75f21189c74", "ja": "あら、{$P$}もですの？\nわたくしと同じですわね。ふふっ。", "zh": "哎呀，{$P$}也是吗？\n和我就一样了呢。呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_038chz0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_038chz0314_1007_038chz", "source_sha256": "d0a82137327e4e9ad4d823b7726e5885c481f295d6e78ebfc57ecd173d6cb7c6", "ja": "おもちゃのステッキをもらった時は、わたくしも\n魔法使いになれたと思って、ワクワクしましたわ。", "zh": "拿到玩具魔法棒的时候，我也  \n以为自己能成为魔法师，兴奋得不得了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_038chz0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_038chz0314_1008_038chz", "source_sha256": "185d3f6cec04e5d7f42453c0de63e138f1182a9f74cdaf6e0c0339627189ac42", "ja": "まあ、実際に魔法は使えませんでしたが……。\n身近にあるものを使って、真似事なんかしたりして。", "zh": "不过，实际上并不能使用魔法就是了……\n用身边的东西，模仿着玩一玩之类的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_038chz0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_038chz0314_1009_p", "source_sha256": "eb06ac61d656fd38e5b35327bd4cad3b56c92c97c7d5d50f9b0f919e15bb8b18", "ja": "ああ、わかります。ホウキにまたがってみたり、\n空き箱を組み合わせて、武器を作ったりしてましたね。", "zh": "啊，我明白。比如骑在扫帚上，\n或者把空箱子拼在一起做成武器。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_038chz0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_038chz0314_1010_038chz", "source_sha256": "10489d072642772ebf07d1f9e4103134d650fa664994de4e18924a10368923f6", "ja": "ええ。身近な物を別の物に変えてしまうなんて……\n子ども達の方が、魔法使いみたいですわね。", "zh": "是啊。把身边的东西变成别的东西……孩子们反而更像魔法师呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_038chz0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_038chz0314_1011_038chz", "source_sha256": "46f3c9ceff46dff443e3cd712db0c0bb42045efae24710df968f3cc005356548", "ja": "そう考えると、小さいころのわたくしは、\n今より魔法使いの素質があったのかもしれませんわね。", "zh": "这么一想，小时候的我，说不定比现在更有成为魔法师的资质呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_038chz0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_038chz0314_1012_p", "source_sha256": "3ad4c46bc2a47b9f1fc810ac9f9f8ae4bd5190ae8d03be79cfdb3b209b624218", "ja": "そうですか？\n今の千鶴さんの方が、立派な魔法使いです！", "zh": "是这样吗？\n现在的千鹤小姐才是出色的魔法师！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_038chz0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_038chz0314_1013_038chz", "source_sha256": "18457fe476bf07510bb073ed8fc59f022f61c39c7582ba6523f6f5774a5cc8a1", "ja": "ふふっ。嬉しい言葉ですけど、\nわたくしがこの衣装を着ているから、そう思うのでは？", "zh": "呵呵。虽然这话让我很高兴，\n但您该不会是因为我穿着这身服装，才这么觉得的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_038chz0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_038chz0314_1014_p", "source_sha256": "f191e5396ac30707259d5f05f2629240230706cad0339ccd9929b061594c2f3c", "ja": "いいえ。千鶴さんがステージに立つと、お客さんは\nみんな笑顔になる。千鶴さんの魔法のひとつです。", "zh": "不。千鹤小姐站上舞台时，客人们都会露出笑容。这就是千鹤小姐的魔法之一。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_038chz0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_038chz0314_1015_038chz", "source_sha256": "32895e96716649b6168da664d5dc1246ea6f8f3cef13dcea30591104cbac6259", "ja": "ま、まあ……。でも、わたくしが魔法を使えるように\nなったのは、{$P$}のおかげですわ。", "zh": "嘛、嘛……不过，我之所以能施展魔法，也是多亏了{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_038chz0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_038chz0314_1016_038chz", "source_sha256": "5c87a3a4378805d9f1956c7cd0031353f4bd6df6bcd77c09db5300e73d0495ab", "ja": "アイドルという魔法があれば、\nどんなこともできる……なりたい自分にだって……。", "zh": "只要有名为偶像的魔法，什么都能做到……哪怕是成为自己想成为的模样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_038chz0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_038chz0314_1017_038chz", "source_sha256": "e7e5c77c742d3ea59e72e3d62648fe19854c422be0ca2941236dc288f59411cf", "ja": "{$P$}、期待していてくださいまし。\nセレブな魔法で、みなさまを笑顔にしてみせますわ♪", "zh": "{$P$}，请期待吧。我要用名媛的魔法，让大家绽放笑容♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
